---
// 原生主题切换按钮（vanilla，无 React 岛）：
// - 视觉状态（渐变底/滑块/图标/辉光）全部由 html.dark 驱动，head 内 FOUC 脚本
//   在 body 解析前就已落好 dark 类，因此首帧即正确、无闪换。
// - 交互（点击切换 + aria-label 同步）由 BaseLayout.astro body 末尾的
//   is:inline 脚本以事件委托服务全站（桌面 nav + 移动端两个按钮）。
// - SSR 恒为天使态，与旧 React 版一致；真实态由脚本在加载后同步。
---

<button type="button" data-theme-toggle class="theme-toggle" aria-label="切换到恶魔模式">
  <span class="theme-toggle-knob" aria-hidden="true">
    <!-- lucide sun（与旧 React 版等价，strokeWidth 2.5） -->
    <svg
      class="theme-toggle-sun h-4 w-4 text-pink-500"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2.5"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
    >
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle>
      <path d="M12 2v2"></path>
      <path d="M12 20v2"></path>
      <path d="m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"></path>
      <path d="m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"></path>
      <path d="M2 12h2"></path>
      <path d="M20 12h2"></path>
      <path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"></path>
      <path d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"></path>
    </svg>
    <!-- lucide moon -->
    <svg
      class="theme-toggle-moon h-4 w-4 text-blue-500"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2.5"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
    >
      <path
        d="M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401"
      ></path>
    </svg>
  </span>
  <!-- 天使光环 / 恶魔辉光（同一个元素，CSS 按 html.dark 切换样式） -->
  <span class="theme-toggle-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</button>

<style>
  /* 尺寸/位移与旧 React 版逐值对齐（w-16 h-8 p-1 / w-6 h-6 top-1 / left 4px ↔ calc(100% - 28px)） */
  .theme-toggle {
    position: relative;
    width: 4rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    padding: 0.25rem;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, oklch(0.78 0.1 15), oklch(0.72 0.12 15));
  }

  :global(html.dark) .theme-toggle {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, oklch(0.72 0.08 240), oklch(0.64 0.1 240));
  }

  .theme-toggle-knob {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.25rem;
    left: 0.25rem;
    display: flex;
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px oklch(0.72 0.12 15 / 0.3);
  }

  :global(html.dark) .theme-toggle-knob {
    left: calc(100% - 28px);
    background: #0f0f12;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px oklch(0.64 0.1 240 / 0.4);
  }

  .theme-toggle-moon {
    display: none;
  }

  :global(html.dark) .theme-toggle-moon {
    display: block;
  }

  :global(html.dark) .theme-toggle-sun {
    display: none;
  }

  .theme-toggle-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 5rem;
    height: 5rem;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.3;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, oklch(0.72 0.12 15 / 0.4) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  :global(html.dark) .theme-toggle-glow {
    opacity: 0.4;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, oklch(0.64 0.1 240 / 0.5) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }
</style>
